1
00:00:01,075 --> 00:00:02,381
As Uke comes forward

2
00:00:03,782 --> 00:00:06,977
step in deeply underneath the arm
with the opposite leg

3
00:00:06,978 --> 00:00:08,293
turn and cut down,

4
00:00:08,694 --> 00:00:10,104
bring Uke down in front of you

5
00:00:10,105 --> 00:00:11,700
control the head, the wrist

6
00:00:12,101 --> 00:00:16,407
then step forward deeply
and extend Uke away

